{
  "uid": "eat-app",
  "title": "eat — Spring app",
  "tags": ["eat", "app"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "請求速率 (req/s)，依狀態碼",
      "description": "sum by (status) rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m])。壓測時看這裡：正常都在 200；一旦冒出 502（llama.cpp 那頭掛/逾時）或 400（送錯），就會多一條線出來。已排除 /actuator/prometheus 自己被抓取的流量，免得蓋過真實請求。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri!=\"/actuator/prometheus\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "/api/chat 延遲 (p95 / p99)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile 從 http_server_requests_seconds_bucket 算出的長尾延遲。⚠️ 需要 application.properties 的 percentiles-histogram=true，app 重啟後才有 buckets、這個 panel 才有資料。平均會把長尾藏起來，壓測要看的就是這條 p99。圖上的小菱形是 exemplar：某個真實請求的耗時，帶著它的 trace id，滑過去點一下就跳到 Tempo 看那個請求每一段花多久。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/api/chat\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{uri=\"/api/chat\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "平均延遲，依 endpoint",
      "description": "rate(sum)/rate(count) —— 每個 endpoint 的平均耗時。/api/chat 會明顯比別人高（後面掛著 LLM）。這個不必 histogram 就有；要看長尾還是得靠上面的 p95/p99。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{uri!=\"/actuator/prometheus\"}[1m])) / sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{uri!=\"/actuator/prometheus\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM Heap 使用量",
      "description": "jvm_memory_used_bytes vs jvm_memory_max_bytes（area=heap）。看記憶體吃多少、離上限多遠。壓測時若已用量一路貼近上限、GC 壓不下來，就是另一種瓶頸（跟 llama.cpp 的排隊是不同層的問題）。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "已用"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "上限"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
